Regulatory & Red Flag Targets: Search for USDA Animal Welfare Act (AWA) inspection reports, citations, and enforcement actions. Check compliance with regional animal testing bans (e.g., EU Regulation 1223/2009 and state cruelty-free cosmetics laws). Investigate undercover animal cruelty exposés by organizations such as the Humane Society, Mercy For Animals, or PETA, and verify genuine independent humane certifications (e.g., Leaping Bunny, Certified Humane) against misleading "humanewashing" marketing.